# Privacy Policy for Vidhauler

Last updated: October 6, 2026

Vidhauler is committed to protecting user privacy.

1. No Data Collection
Vidhauler does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data, IP addresses, or browsing history. All operations run 100% locally on your computer.

2. Permissions
- downloads: Used solely to save detected media files directly to your Downloads folder upon clicking download.
- storage: Used solely to cache media links for the current tab and store license entitlement status locally.
- activeTab: Used solely to inspect the current active tab for media elements when you click the extension icon.
- host_permissions: Used to scan educational portals (Canvas, Blackboard, Panopto, Kaltura) and web pages for media.

3. Third-Party Services
Vidhauler does not sell, rent, or share any user data with third parties. In compliance with Google Chrome Web Store policies, Vidhauler does not download videos from YouTube.

4. Contact & Support
For support and questions: https://github.com/Beastyboy44/-Vidhauler
